{"4767480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lords of the Fallen II", "steam_appid": 4767480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "A thousand years have passed since the Great Rupture. <br><br>Realm by realm, nation after nation, the Umbral darkness has consumed all in her path. One Kingdom remains - a sacred land shrouded by an ancient force. For a time, mankind found sanctuary in this haven, but as light fades, darkness rises, and now, the Eternal Night draws near. <br><br>A hero must rise, for a God to fall.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras/90d63e5b4665e425e7cd6d4c726f00be.avif?t=1782480305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras_big/90d63e5b4665e425e7cd6d4c726f00be.webp?t=1782480305 width=1560 height=677 /></span><br>Journey across a vast, war-torn kingdom crumbling from within, as the realms of living and dead bleed into one. From moonlit citadels to time-ravaged temples, tread carefully, for each step forward may well be your last. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras/80a832ff31f85af0422871b9e4b3b203.avif?t=1782480305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras_big/80a832ff31f85af0422871b9e4b3b203.webp?t=1782480305 width=1560 height=677 /></span><br>Engage in intense, soulslike battles where every strike counts thanks to a fast, fluid and aggressive combat system. Whether steel or sorcery, melee or ranged, experiment with countless builds to overcome each unique enemy encounter before delivering an arena-drenching execution. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras/68283e95aff87621088ba5dd898309d6.avif?t=1782480305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras_big/68283e95aff87621088ba5dd898309d6.webp?t=1782480305 width=1560 height=677 /></span><br>Confront colossal abominations forged in a world without hope and void of mercy. Each distinct boss battle showdown will prove a gruelling test of skill, grit, and will. Though aid is at hand, should you seek it…<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras/3a30419dc6056acf54f16dfd7cc0bf47.avif?t=1782480305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras_big/3a30419dc6056acf54f16dfd7cc0bf47.webp?t=1782480305 width=1560 height=677 /></span><br>As bearer of the Umbral lamp, you have the ability to pass between the realms of the living and the dead, each with its own pathways, treasures, and of course, nightmarish creatures. But even greater, darker powers await you on this journey… <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras/ddf3be24fe3d38ea26bbd6d01bcb4445.avif?t=1782480305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras_big/ddf3be24fe3d38ea26bbd6d01bcb4445.webp?t=1782480305 width=1560 height=677 /></span><br>Journey through Thorngar alone or alongside a fellow Lampbearer in seamless online co-op. Both players will save all mainline progression in shared campaign mode, or join a casual session to simply lend a fellow crusader a helping hand. <br>", "about_the_game": "A thousand years have passed since the Great Rupture. <br><br>Realm by realm, nation after nation, the Umbral darkness has consumed all in her path. One Kingdom remains - a sacred land shrouded by an ancient force. For a time, mankind found sanctuary in this haven, but as light fades, darkness rises, and now, the Eternal Night draws near. <br><br>A hero must rise, for a God to fall.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras/90d63e5b4665e425e7cd6d4c726f00be.avif?t=1782480305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras_big/90d63e5b4665e425e7cd6d4c726f00be.webp?t=1782480305 width=1560 height=677 /></span><br>Journey across a vast, war-torn kingdom crumbling from within, as the realms of living and dead bleed into one. From moonlit citadels to time-ravaged temples, tread carefully, for each step forward may well be your last. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras/80a832ff31f85af0422871b9e4b3b203.avif?t=1782480305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras_big/80a832ff31f85af0422871b9e4b3b203.webp?t=1782480305 width=1560 height=677 /></span><br>Engage in intense, soulslike battles where every strike counts thanks to a fast, fluid and aggressive combat system. Whether steel or sorcery, melee or ranged, experiment with countless builds to overcome each unique enemy encounter before delivering an arena-drenching execution. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras/68283e95aff87621088ba5dd898309d6.avif?t=1782480305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767480/extras_big/68283e95aff87621088ba5dd898309d6.webp?t=1782480305 width=1560 height=677 /></span><br>Confront colossal abominations forged in a world without hope and void of mercy. Each distinct boss battle showdown will prove a gruelling test of skill, grit, and will. Though aid is at hand, should you seek it…<br><br><span class=\"bb_img